OL,3,GNEWSAFootball fans angry at sponsor's
OL,4,Alink to porn actress
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football fan group has expressed
OL,7,F"dismay" that Leicester City's main
OL,8,Fshirt sponsor has appointed a porn
OL,9,Factress as an ambassador.
OL,11,FBC Game - which was named as a sponsor
OL,12,Ffor the League One side at the start of
OL,13,Fthe 2024-25 season - named Eva Elfie as
OL,14,Fa brand ambassador on Tuesday.
OL,16,FThe online gambling company posted a
OL,17,Fvideo of Elfie and a delivery driver on
OL,18,Fsocial media, with the caption:
OL,19,F"Welcome to BC Game Eva Elfie! Let the
OL,20,Ffun begin."
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
