OL,3,GNEWSAFootball fans angry at sponsor's
OL,4,Alink to porn actress
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Foxes Trust said gambling and
OL,7,Fpornography could have "devastating
OL,8,Fimpacts", and added: "Partnerships like
OL,9,Fthese bring these two worlds to a
OL,10,Flarger audience and, by association,
OL,11,Flink them to Leicester City."
